epo": "university-programming", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f432a002f9f97d98a85d8498cd2d4b9b1e29ddb5", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2017-11-21T15:00:23Z", "repo": "university-programming", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "863ef60e04a484d1c939412407c229edb4a0e8a0", "message": "Update status of publications", "created_at": "2026-01-09T17:45:41Z", "repo": "jingmatrix.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "17c12ef99ecebf89dc53447d00c2a54464fc3cb1", "message": "Improve CSS style of author information block\n\nTailwind CSS organizes its styles into three main layers: base, components, and utilities.\nCurrently, the style of vitepress is overriding layers style.\n\nWe add `!important` to fix the image height overriding, and use\n1. set the main div as a flex container that aligns all its children vertically to the center\n2. explicitly setting the width (w-10) to match the height ensures the image is a perfect circle. object-cover will prevent the image from being distorted if its aspect ratio isn't 1:1.", "created_at": "2026-01-07T16:59:44Z", "repo": "jingmatrix.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "14e269f1779907e6320b2ee73bbf46a55855614b", "message": "Update tutorial of adding bookmarks\n\nThe structure of https://github.com/JingMatrix/Shell is changed, we should thus also update the tutorial.", "created_at": "2026-01-07T16:39:36Z", "repo": "jingmatrix.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e0a68327b624291436f25a5e1580d5765c8f220", "message": "Correctly import Utterances\n\nWe should avoid importing Utterances during the sever-side build.\n\nThe dependencies are also upgraded.", "created_at": "2025-12-27T10:58:20Z", "repo": "jingmatrix.github.io", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_fi